{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:31eae96e9dfd5e6c","name":"ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle","source":{"id":"source:reference-31eae96e9dfd5e6c","title":"ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle","revision":15614,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:52:53Z","sha256":"aed07365523102d13f2de84294ff6b4fe2da05e9861451d6f0157263ee740f23","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15614","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=ARC-9965%20Blaster%20Rifle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-31eae96e9dfd5e6c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The chosen weapon of the Imperial Stormtrooper Corps, the ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle from BlasTech is a significant upgrade over the E-11 Blaster Rifles used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtroopers"}," during the Galactic Civil War. It is designed with accuracy in mind, with input from some of the galaxy's best sharpshooters. The ARC-9965 is not without its flaws. The higher-accuracy blaster bolts consume more energy than a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"},", lowering its ammunition capacity. Additionally, since the weapon is designed more for accuracy than for sprays of fire, each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack made with the weapon consumes 10 shots. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 40 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced. The ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle also has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Retractable Stock"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retractable_Stock","referenceId":"reference:c46421d1c6248b43"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Accurate:"]}," This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
